REVERSE ENGINEERING

The distributed form of this package is a build, not readable source. It is
compressed deliberately. Deterrence of unauthorised reuse is provided by this
licence, by the registry integrity hash, and by law — and it is reinforced by
not shipping the implementation in a form that can be lifted with a text
editor.

Nothing in this section restricts your right to inspect what runs on your own
machine, and nothing in it narrows clause 2 above: you may decompile or
disassemble this package in order to satisfy yourself about it. What you may
not do is use what you learn to build, ship, or train anything. Inspection for
your own assurance is permitted; reuse is not.

